#: of pwnlib.log.Logger.progress:4
msgid ""
"An optional ``rate`` parameter can be specified to control the frequency "
"of status updates. Calls to :meth:`Progress.status` will be throttled to "
"at most one update per `rate` seconds. Throtteled status updates will not"
" be emitted at all, so they will not show up in log files. Use this to "
"avoid generating too many log records in tight loops."
msgstr ""

#: of pwnlib.log.Logger.progress:9
